  <item>
    <title>vol.15 30岁素人，想开一场个人演唱会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c18880db5e6d6bf9157a5b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c18880db5e6d6bf9157a5b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Aug 2024 05:37:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是30岁自嗨特别节目——一场线上版个人演唱会！</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>春天的时候曾经立下过一个flag：30岁生日的时候在KTV开一场个人演唱会。奈何生日月过于忙碌未能成行，所以把这个心愿搬到播客来实现。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期将听到我通过K歌软件翻唱的9首歌曲，外加15岁的暑假在老台式机上录制的一首歌，作为彩蛋。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线如下：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">00:01</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>《手的预言》cover 陈绮贞</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">01:27</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么想做这场线上演唱会？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="383">06:23</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>荒漠童年的金曲记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="503">08:23</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>《我可以抱你吗》cover 张惠妹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>教爱情歌曲的小学音乐老师，但替换了“爱”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="833">13:53</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>《遇见》cover 孙燕姿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="979">16:19</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>她们，掌管90后童年的神</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1066">17:46</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>《潘朵拉》 cover 张韶涵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1197">19:57</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>《超级玛丽》cover 田馥甄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1434">23:54</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>陈绮贞、王菲，后青春时期的女侠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1495">24:55</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>《九份的咖啡店》cover 陈绮贞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1772">29:32</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>《我爱你》cover 王菲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1981">33:01</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>成年后，开始听懂爱恨悲欢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">33:55</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>《烟霞》cover 容祖儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2266">37:46</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>30岁重新认识自己：“我有很多可以输出的爱”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2312">38:32</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>《慢慢喜欢你》cover 徐佳莹（蒙面歌王版）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2592">43:12</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>别急着关，还有一首结尾彩蛋。</span></p><span></span><p><span>15岁录制的《那些花儿》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkGHZegQWsdFF2lXCRbBqlsq2p5l.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>感谢收听，期待用声音和你交换更多“内心戏”~</span></p>]]></description>
